 BSE| Energy difference of last empty index to LUMO [eV]                 179.459
 BSE| Number of GW-corrected occupied MOs                                     11
 BSE| Number of GW-corrected empty MOs                                        37
 BSE|
 BSE| No truncation of BSE matrices applied
 BSE|
